@Warehouse.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5189
@TransferTenantId = 1
@InvalidPublicId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@TransferPublicId = 1a15df1c-6af2-495a-8a39-8da6a7aa37a6
@TenantPublicId = 3e88f06f-530f-41e9-998e-1ec23725a0e2
@WarehousePublicId = 6285358d-f941-412f-b291-72dc36b06ce1
@TransferCursor = eyJWZXJzaW9uIjoxLCJDcmVhdGVkQXRVdGMiOiIyMDI2LTEwLTE5VDIyOjIwOjUwLjk2OTg4MzUiLCJJZCI6NywiQmFja3dhcmRzIjpmYWxzZSwiQ29udGV4dCI6IjAyQUQzNTZBQTExMjgxRDhGMkYzNkQ2MkFBRUU1MTNEMTkzNDgzQTcwOEIwNjMyNEY0Rjk4RkFGNUNGNEYwQkYifQ

### database readiness (development only)
GET {{Warehouse.Api_HostAddress}}/health

### process liveness (development only -- independent of SQL)
GET {{Warehouse.Api_HostAddress}}/alive

### first page (search transfers by Product SKU)
GET {{Warehouse.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transfers?q=P1-TOMATO-SEED&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json

### next page: keep exactly the same search and page size
GET {{Warehouse.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transfers?q=P1-TOMATO-SEED&pageSize=5&cursor={{TransferCursor}}
Accept: application/json

### transfer lines (search by Product SKU)
GET {{Warehouse.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transfer-lines?q=P1-TOMATO-SEED&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json

### read-only receipt retrieval (received: 200/replay; approved: 409; wrong tenant: 404)
GET {{Warehouse.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transfers/{{TransferTenantId}}/{{TransferPublicId}}/completion
Accept: application/json

### invalid low-stock threshold is a structured 400 before SQL (even for nonexistent IDs)
GET {{Warehouse.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{TenantPublicId}}/warehouses/{{WarehousePublicId}}/stock-availability?lowStockThreshold=1000000000000000
Accept: application/problem+json

### low-stock upper supported boundary
GET {{Warehouse.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{TenantPublicId}}/warehouses/{{WarehousePublicId}}/stock-availability?lowStockThreshold=999999999999999.9999
Accept: application/json

### invalid cursor is a structured 400 before SQL
GET {{Warehouse.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transfers?cursor=invalid
Accept: application/problem+json

### all tenants 
GET {{Warehouse.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tenants
Accept: application/json

### tenant by TenantPublicId
GET {{Warehouse.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{TenantPublicId}}
Accept: application/json

### invalid TenantPublicId is a 404 Not Found
GET {{Warehouse.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{InvalidPublicId}}
Accept: application/json

### all of a tenant's warehouses
GET {{Warehouse.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{TenantPublicId}}/warehouses
Accept: application/json

### all transfer lines
GET {{Warehouse.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transfer-lines
Accept: application/json

### all transfers
GET {{Warehouse.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transfers
Accept: application/json

### all approved transfers
GET {{Warehouse.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transfers?q=APPROVED
Accept: application/json

### search transfers by partial TenantName
GET {{Warehouse.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transfers?q=Greenleaf
Accept: application/json

### search transfers by InventoryLots.LotNumber
GET {{Warehouse.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transfers?q=P1-TOMATO-A
Accept: application/json

### search transfers by partial InventoryLots.LotNumber
GET {{Warehouse.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transfers?q=Basil
Accept: application/json